{
  "schema_version": 2,
  "diagram_type": "workflow",
  "meta": {
    "title": "Kimi K3 KDA RecoverSSM 投机推理：verify → 拒绝采样 → commit 全流程",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "quality_profile": "showcase",
    "views": [
      {
        "id": "verify-view",
        "label": "verify 与记录",
        "focus": [
          "prev_state",
          "select",
          "verify_kernel",
          "records"
        ],
        "note": "验证前向只读 checkpoint，把 key / raw gate / correction 向量写入 pending 记录。"
      },
      {
        "id": "commit-view",
        "label": "采样与 commit",
        "focus": [
          "reject_sample",
          "commit_kernel",
          "mirror",
          "records"
        ],
        "note": "拒绝采样后立即 commit：重建已接受前缀的 current state 并镜像回原生槽位。"
      },
      {
        "id": "draft-view",
        "label": "草稿与下一轮",
        "focus": [
          "mirror",
          "mtp_draft",
          "next_step",
          "prev_state"
        ],
        "note": "commit 先于 草稿模型前向；下一轮 verify 按新 accepted 数重新选择 checkpoint。"
      }
    ]
  },
  "lanes": [
    {
      "id": "target",
      "label": "目标模型前向 + RecoverSSM Adapter"
    },
    {
      "id": "store",
      "label": "状态与记录存储"
    },
    {
      "id": "draft",
      "label": "草稿模型"
    }
  ],
  "phases": [
    {
      "id": "p_verify",
      "label": "① 目标模型前向：verify + 记录 R_t",
      "fromCol": 0,
      "toCol": 1,
      "variant": "emphasis"
    },
    {
      "id": "p_sample",
      "label": "② 拒绝采样",
      "fromCol": 2,
      "toCol": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "p_commit",
      "label": "③ commit：重建写回 → 草稿",
      "fromCol": 3,
      "toCol": 4,
      "variant": "dashed"
    }
  ],
  "mainPath": [
    "prev_state",
    "select",
    "verify_kernel",
    "reject_sample",
    "commit_kernel",
    "mirror",
    "mtp_draft",
    "next_step"
  ],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "prev_state",
      "lane": "store",
      "col": 0,
      "type": "database",
      "label": "原生 recurrent state 槽位",
      "sublabel": "已提交的 checkpoint S₀",
      "width": 176
    },
    {
      "id": "select",
      "lane": "target",
      "col": 0,
      "type": "backend",
      "label": "verify：选择 checkpoint",
      "sublabel": "按 prev accepted−1 取 S₀",
      "width": 190
    },
    {
      "id": "verify_kernel",
      "lane": "target",
      "col": 1,
      "type": "backend",
      "label": "verify：逐 token 递推",
      "sublabel": "S_t=S_{t−1}D_t+u_tk̂ᵀ；y_t=S_tq̂",
      "tag": "验证前向",
      "width": 176
    },
    {
      "id": "records",
      "lane": "store",
      "col": 1,
      "type": "database",
      "label": "存储向量记录 R_t（pending）",
      "sublabel": "R_t=(u_t, k_t, g_raw_t)，O(V+2K)",
      "tag": "仅存于 verify→采样之间",
      "width": 184
    },
    {
      "id": "reject_sample",
      "lane": "target",
      "col": 2,
      "type": "security",
      "label": "RejectionSampler 拒绝采样",
      "sublabel": "n=(ids≥0).sum 含 bonus，−1 排除",
      "tag": "决定 accepted 数",
      "width": 176
    },
    {
      "id": "commit_kernel",
      "lane": "target",
      "col": 3,
      "type": "backend",
      "label": "commit：重建 S_rebuilt",
      "sublabel": "U+=u_tk̂ᵀP；P←D_tP（t=n…1）",
      "tag": "状态重建",
      "width": 190
    },
    {
      "id": "mirror",
      "lane": "store",
      "col": 3,
      "type": "database",
      "label": "更新 recurrent state",
      "sublabel": "S_rebuilt=S₀P+U 写回 slot，释放 R_t",
      "tag": "写入",
      "width": 200
    },
    {
      "id": "mtp_draft",
      "lane": "draft",
      "col": 4,
      "type": "backend",
      "label": "草稿模型前向",
      "sublabel": "commit 完成后才起草",
      "width": 176
    },
    {
      "id": "next_step",
      "lane": "store",
      "col": 4,
      "type": "database",
      "label": "下一轮 verify",
      "sublabel": "以 S_rebuilt 为新 S₀",
      "width": 176
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "e-read",
      "from": "prev_state",
      "to": "select",
      "variant": "default"
    },
    {
      "id": "e-ckpt",
      "from": "select",
      "to": "verify_kernel",
      "label": "checkpoint S₀（块 0=padding）",
      "variant": "emphasis"
    },
    {
      "id": "e-store",
      "from": "verify_kernel",
      "to": "records",
      "variant": "emphasis"
    },
    {
      "id": "e-out",
      "from": "verify_kernel",
      "to": "reject_sample",
      "label": "y_t→logits",
      "variant": "default"
    },
    {
      "id": "e-replay",
      "from": "records",
      "to": "commit_kernel",
      "label": "按接受前缀 n 重放 R_t",
      "variant": "dashed",
      "role": "branch",
      "toSide": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "e-sample",
      "from": "reject_sample",
      "to": "commit_kernel",
      "variant": "security",
      "toSide": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "e-rebuild",
      "from": "commit_kernel",
      "to": "mirror",
      "variant": "emphasis"
    },
    {
      "id": "e-before-draft",
      "from": "mirror",
      "to": "mtp_draft",
      "label": "先于草稿前向完成",
      "variant": "default"
    },
    {
      "id": "e-next",
      "from": "mirror",
      "to": "next_step",
      "variant": "dashed"
    },
    {
      "id": "e-draft-next",
      "from": "mtp_draft",
      "to": "next_step",
      "label": "草稿 token",
      "variant": "default"
    }
  ],
  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "存储 / 重建 / 写入（对照公式）",
      "items": [
        "存储：verify 逐位置保存 R_t=(u_t, k_t, g_raw_t)，开销 O(V+2K)，不改写 S₀",
        "重建：commit 反向累积 U+=u_tk̂ᵀP、P←D_tP，得 S_rebuilt=S₀P+U（等价闭式 S₀D_1…D_n+Σu_ik̂_iᵀD_{i+1}…D_n）",
        "写入：S_rebuilt 写回原生 slot 并镜像到全部槽位，随后释放本轮 R_t"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "顺序契约",
      "items": [
        "verify 只读 S₀，原生 state 在验证前向期间保持不变",
        "拒绝采样确定 n 后立即 commit，且 commit 先于草稿模型前向",
        "commit 前的二次 verify 直接报错，不会静默覆盖 pending 记录"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "存储量级",
      "items": [
        "原生方案：每位置存整份矩阵，O(L·H·V·K)",
        "RecoverSSM：HVK（checkpoint）+ LH(V+2K)（R_t 记录）"
      ]
    }
  ]
}